### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### List complaints
GET http://localhost:8080/api/complaints

### Search complaints
GET http://localhost:8080/api/complaints?q=grade&status=Open&priority=High

### Create complaint
POST http://localhost:8080/api/complaints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Student",
  "studentId": "S123456",
  "email": "alice@example.edu",
  "course": "IT342",
  "category": "Academic",
  "priority": "High",
  "subject": "Missing grade",
  "description": "My grade is not visible in the student portal."
}

### Update status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/complaints/c-replace-this-id/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "In Progress"
}

### Assign complaint
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/complaints/c-replace-this-id/assignment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignedTo": "Registrar Office"
}

### Add comment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/complaints/c-replace-this-id/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Forwarded to the registrar for verification."
}

### Delete complaint
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/complaints/c-replace-this-id
